The server will enable developers worldwide to build applications that solve real-world problems while maintaining the highest standards of security, compliance, and social responsibility.


    - A background process subscribes to on-chain events from the PactDa smart contracts.
    - When a relevant event is detected, it pushes a message to a managed WebSocket service (e.g., Ably, Pusher).
    - SDK clients connect to this WebSocket service to receive updates.

